      "JANET: What do you do Gabby?\nGABBY: I teach first graders for the school district. So dealing with a bunch of cops is easy for me.\nJANET: You know I never dated a cop before.\nGABBY: Good. That's a good sign. You'll get used to it. Sort of.",
